### Company Overview
**NVIDIA Corporation** is a leading American multinational technology company headquartered in Santa Clara, California. It specializes in the design and manufacturing of advanced graphics processing units (GPUs) for gaming and professional markets. NVIDIA has positioned itself at the forefront of artificial intelligence (AI) and visual computing technologies, developing products that power AI infrastructure, gaming, data centers, and automotive applications, especially in autonomous driving. 

