| MACD      | 0.173                | Positive momentum |
| MACD Signal | 0.075              | MACD above Signal, confirming trend |
| RSI       | 57.52                | No overbought conditions |
| Bollinger Middle | 58.94         | Price stabilizing |
| ATR       | 0.775                | Moderate volatility |

In conclusion, the current analysis supports a bullish outlook with moderate volatility, suggesting continued growth potential for WMT while maintaining a reasonable risk level.
